# Agent Forge web product — environment.
#
# The web app requires NO environment variables at runtime. It has no backend,
# database, authentication, or secrets; the engine's evaluation data is vendored
# in web/engine-data/ and baked into the pages at build time.
#
# This file exists to make that explicit and to hold optional, non-secret
# settings only. Never put a real secret here or in the client bundle.
#
# Optional (leave unset unless you want it):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL   # canonical https origin, used only for absolute links
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
